---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
import Icon from "./Icon.astro";
import { stats } from "../data/skills";
---

<section id="about" data-section="about" class="section-y">
  <div class="shell">
    <SectionHeading
      index="01"
      title="Equations taught me to be careful. Data taught me to be useful."
      kicker="A mathematics graduate who moved from proofs to understanding, cleaning, validating and visualising data until it says something a team can act on."
    />

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-12 md:mt-16 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_0.95fr] lg:gap-20">
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <p class="font-display text-[clamp(1.35rem,2.4vw,1.85rem)] leading-[1.3] text-ink" data-reveal>
          I studied the structure underneath problems. Now I work on the data
          that describes them from a messy spreadsheet to a dashboard someone
          actually trusts.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-5 text-[14.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft md:text-[15px]" data-reveal>
          <p>
            My background is a Bachelor of Mathematics from Universitas Jenderal
            Soedirman, graduated with a 3.80 / 4.00 GPA. Statistics, modelling and
            numerical methods gave me the analytical foundation; internships,
            academic projects and independent learning turned it into practice.
          </p>
          <p>
            At Statistics Indonesia (BPS) Kota Bekasi I processed, cleaned and
            validated 50+ statistical survey datasets, running data quality checks
            to BPS standards and helping prepare the reports that followed. Alongside
            that I built SQL cleaning pipelines, explored COVID-19 and healthcare
            workforce data, and shipped interactive dashboards in Tableau and Excel.
          </p>
          <p>
            I care about the unglamorous part: consistent formats, documented
            assumptions, numbers that reconcile. That is usually what makes an
            insight survive contact with a decision.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-3 pt-2" data-reveal>
          <a href="#work" class="link-line text-[13.5px] font-medium text-ink">
            See how I work
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/agie-nugroho/"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="link-line inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[13.5px] text-muted hover:text-ink"
          >
            LinkedIn
            <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={13} />
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-sm border border-line bg-line" data-reveal>
        {
          stats.map((stat) => (
            <div class="group bg-paper p-6 transition-colors duration-500 hover:bg-raise md:p-7">
              <p class="flex items-baseline font-mono text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.15rem)] leading-none tracking-[-0.02em] text-ink">
                <span data-count={stat.value} data-decimals={stat.decimals ?? 0}>
                  {stat.decimals ? stat.value.toFixed(stat.decimals) : stat.value}
                </span>
                <span class="text-accent">{stat.suffix}</span>
              </p>
              <p class="mt-3 text-[12.5px] leading-snug text-muted">{stat.label}</p>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
